# [SAAG](../wg/saag.html)

## Summary

The Security Area Advisory Group (SAAG) met at IETF 127. Area Directors Deb Cooley and Chris Inacio provided updates on Security Area working group status, errata processing, and SecDir review statistics. The session featured three technical presentations: an overview of security operations guidance for protocol designers, a proposal for Remote Two-Factor Protective Services (R2PS), and an academic overview of digital ID verification, security, and privacy mechanisms. The session concluded with open mic discussions covering post-quantum transition issues, key parsing failures in JSON Web Key (JWK) libraries, and venues for discussing security vulnerabilities.

---

